{"id": "10th-u1-q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "urai_nadaiyin_aninangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "antithesis_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"குடிசைகள் ஒரு பக்கம்; கோபுரங்கள் மறுபக்கம்; பசித்த வயிறுகள் ஒரு பக்கம்; புளிச்சேப்பக்காரர்கள் மறுபக்கம்...\" - இவ்வுரைநடைப் பகுதிக்குரிய அணி உத்தி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "முரண்படு மெய்ம்மை", "C": "சொல் முரண்", "D": "எதிரிணை இயைபு (Antithesis)"}, "explanation": "சமூகத்தின் இரு துருவங்களை எதிரெதிராக வைத்து விளக்கியுள்ளதால் இது \"எதிரிணை இயைபு\" (Antithesis) எனப்படும். (தோழர் ஜீவானந்தம் / அண்ணா நடை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which prose stylistic device is exhibited in: \"Huts on one side, towering mansions on the other; starved bellies on one side, overfed gluttons on the other\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Simile", "B": "Paradox", "C": "Oxymoron", "D": "Antithesis (Ethirinai Iyaibu)"}, "explanation": "Contrasting extreme socio-economic divides in parallel structure is classic Antithesis."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition