{"id": "10th-u1-q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "eluthu_sol", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "moovagai_mozhi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒரு சொல் தனித்து நின்று ஒரு பொருளையும், பிரிந்து நின்று வேறு பொருளையும் தந்து தனிமொழிக்கும் தொடர்மொழிக்கும் பொதுவாய் அமைவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொதுமொழி", "B": "தனிமொழி", "C": "தொடர்மொழி", "D": "மரபுமொழி"}, "explanation": "ஒரு சொல் தனித்து ஒரு பொருளையும், அச்சொல்லே பிரிந்து நின்று வேறொரு பொருளையும் தந்து இரண்டிற்கும் பொதுவாய் அமைவது \"பொதுமொழி\" ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is a word termed when it yields one meaning as a whole unit, but yields another when split, serving both standalone and continuous forms?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pothumozhi (Common/Amphibolic word)", "B": "Thanimozhi", "C": "Thodarmpathozhi", "D": "Marabumozhi"}, "explanation": "Such a word bridging single and compound interpretations is a Pothumozhi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Un