{"id": "10th-u1-q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "eluthu_sol", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thozhirpeyar_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (தொழிற்பெயர் வகைகள்): \nஅ) விகுதிபெற்ற தொழிற்பெயர் - 1) சூடு \nஆ) முதனிலைத் தொழிற்பெயர் - 2) நடவாமை \nஇ) முதனிலை திரிந்த தொழிற்பெயர் - 3) தட்டு \nஈ) எதிர்மறைத் தொழிற்பெயர் - 4) பாடல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-2", "B": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-2", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-2, ஈ-1", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-3, ஈ-4"}, "explanation": "பாடல் = விகுதிபெற்றது; தட்டு = முதனிலை; சூடு = முதனிலை திரிந்தது; நடவாமை = எதிர்மறை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match verbal noun varieties:\na) Suffix-derived verbal noun - 4) Paadal\nb) Bare root verbal noun - 3) Thattu\nc) Root-vowel lengthened verbal noun - 1) Soodu\nd) Negative verbal noun - 2) Nadavaamai", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-3, d-4"}, "explanation": "All verbal noun matches verified."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025